1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Meet Resume Lens: a clearer view of experience, built for human review.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Upload a resume. The application extracts its text and saves a reusable local copy.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Review the professional evidence before analysis. Remove personal details, check the extraction, and confirm what will be sent to the model.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
A persistent job tracks progress. Reload the page, and the application reconnects to the same analysis.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Explore separate screening dimensions, with distributions and clear context. These illustrative probabilities are model outputs, not verified facts or an overall candidate score.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Return to the original PDF and the exact reviewed evidence. Keep the source close to every interpretation.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Revisit saved candidates and their history. Configure questions, rubrics, and manual review thresholds for your workspace.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Clearer evidence. Better human review. This demo uses fictional data and simulated services.
